WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.659
You remember the screenshot. But not its filename.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.728
Describe what you remember. Trovara searches your local
files by their contents.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:18.729
Choose your folders. Download the model once. Then let
Trovara index your files.

4
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:27.338
Press Control, Shift, Space. Search for a red car, even when
its filename tells you nothing.

5
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:36.727
Search security deposit. See the matching PDF page with the
words highlighted. Press Space for a larger preview.

6
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.863
Describe a scene. Find its timestamp in your video, then
play from the matching moment.

7
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.484
Search what you remember hearing. Find the relevant part of
a recording.

8
00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.750
The exam is on Friday.

9
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.164
For developers, optional code search finds functions by what
they do.

10
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:06.829
Your files and searches stay on your PC. After setup, search
works offline.

11
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:14.744
Trovara. Describe it. Find it. Download for Windows.
